~ChangeSpeaker("SCOUT")
~ PlayCutscene("PostMurderKnock")
Meanie? …Meanie, I know you’re in here.
I’m coming in. It’s okay. You’re safe with me.
I promise.
~ PlayCutscene("ScoutEnterHouse")
So… you, uh, you exploded Wally. That was unfortunate.
But it’s okay! Accidents happen.
Which is why I’m here to encourage you to turn yourself in.
It’s the right thing to do. Justice and everything, y’know?
    * "You helped me buy the cake!"
        What? Don’t be silly. I wasn’t the one who picked the flavor out!
        This was all you, Meanie. But it’s okay to lash out.
        I know you’re probably feeling some strong emotions right now.
        I mean, you DID just kill a guy. That’s gotta be a rush!
        -> converge1
    * "It wasn’t my fault!"
        It’s okay to think that, but that’s not gonna hold up in a court of law.
        I mean, you WERE the one who picked out the flavor…
        -> converge1
====converge1====
But… wait…
I DID go into the bakery at the same time as you.
AND I asked how much the cake was. That’s, like, intent to buy, or something.
Which means that in the eyes of the law…
…GAHHH! I’M AN ACCOMPLICE!
Meanie, we’ve gotta get out of here! I won’t last a second in jail!
    * "What do you mean?"
    -> converge2
    * "Huh?"
    -> converge2
==== converge2 ====
Wally had some powerful friends! Dangerous friends!
Between you and me, I’m pretty sure he was cooking meth at some point. 
He had the brains for it, the big nerd he was.
Made bank from it, too! How else do you think he could’ve afforded three whole windows?!
You’d make it through alright. I mean, you just killed somebody! You’re hardcore! I’m a big softie!!
Okay, okay– okay okay. Don’t panic. We just need to get out of the country. Simple! 
Easy! Like– like a vacation!
I… I know a guy who can get us to Canada. 
Give us new identities, new papers. Another chance at life.
It’d be like we just… disappeared. And we REALLY need to disappear. I mean, what else can we do?
So, what? Are you in? There’s no other way out of this.
    * "Yes"
        Alright. I guess we’re doing this
        -> converge3
    * "It was just an accident"
        Meanie, trust me. They won’t believe you.
        You’ll spend the rest of your life in prison, and they won’t stop until I’m in there with you.
        -> converge3
==== converge3 ====
The quickest way to get to my… friend… is through the forest.
We’ll make it through this, I swear. But we have to go, now!
-> END
